## 📌 Project Overview

An interactive Excel MIS dashboard designed to analyze employee performance, working hours, efficiency, break time, and customer interaction metrics.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze employee performance
- Monitor working hours and efficiency
- Track call-related metrics
- Analyze break patterns
- Present key performance indicators through an interactive dashboard

## 📊 Key KPIs

- Working Hours
- Efficiency
- Attended Calls
- Active Time
- Break Time
- Overall Performance

## 🛠️ Tools & Skills

- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Excel Formulas
- KPI Reporting
- Data Analysis
- Dashboard Development
